@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Voucher - View Vouchers

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|User|
start
note right
Precondition:
No sign-in is required.

Postcondition:
Nothing changes. Viewing or copying a code consumes no use.
end note
:Open the home screen or choose to view all vouchers;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |User|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Find the vouchers within their validity with uses left, highest percent first;
if (No voucher is usable?) then (Yes)
  :Return an empty list;
  |User|
  :View the no-voucher message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Return the code, description, percent and expiry of each voucher;
|User|
:View the list;
if (A Guest wants to use a voucher?) then (Yes)
  |System|
  :Remind the guest to sign in to use a voucher at checkout;
  |User|
  :Sign in or keep viewing;
else (No)
  :Choose to copy a code;
  |System|
  :The app copies the code to the clipboard and confirms;
  |User|
  :View the confirmation;
endif
stop

@enduml
